  "knownDifferences": [
    "Normal-difficulty 19-tick red-light reaction window is fixed in this stage.",
    "Same-tick finishes or falls are tied rather than resolved by selector order.",
    "Scene extraction excludes entities and block-entity inventories; decorative barrels and custom skull textures are not reproduced.",
    "Nine newer decorative plants in Tile Capture medium are replaced by 1.21.1 counterparts; resource metadata records exact replacements.",
    "Decorative water and lava remain static inside Party scenes to prevent cropped channels from flowing into other arenas."
